- Walls without streaks;
- The sink is clean (check with a flashlight);
- The sink is not clogged (check how the water drains)
- The mirror is clean (check with flash)
- The shelf with the elephant is clean
- The aroma diffuser is filled to at least 1/5, sticks are turned (moist)
- The cabinet is wiped clean;
- Hand towels - full dispenser;
