- The floor is clean (check with a flashlight).

If not - assign tasks to the cleaner. This should be completed by 12:00.

The restrooms and toilet room are clean, trash bins, sinks, toilets, mirrors are clean, soap dispensers are full, paper towels and toilet paper are available

- Plumbing is clean (sink, toilet - check with a flashlight);
- The toilet brush is clean, the bowl of the brush is clean;
- Dispensers are replenished;
- Toilet paper is hanging;
- Hand towels are available
- The sink is not clogged (check how the water drains)
- The bin is clean, with a trash bag;
- The floor is clean (check with a flashlight).

Check the supplies of consumables at the bar. If any are less than 2 sleeves, write in the Front chat to the shift manager

Supplies for 2 days:
paper cups - 0.25, 0.35, 0.45, plastic - 0.4;
lids - large, small, plastic (uniform size)
blue clay mugs - 0.2, 0.3;
children's mugs - bear-shaped transparent; napkins;
wipes; straws; cup holders;
black gloves sufficient for 2 days
baking paper sufficient for 2 days

Check the supplies of products at the bar. If less than a 2-day supply, write in the Front chat to the shift manager

Check for product availability at the bar: coffee - in the hopper + additional packaging;
milk - 3.2% - no less than 1 box;
non-lactose, coconut, hazelnut, almond milk - no less than 5 packs;

If not, ask the manager to have the cleaner bring down the required amount of milk. If there isn't enough up top, inform the manager in the Front chat
orange juice - no less than 1 liter
fresh lemons - 2 pcs; limes - 2 pcs; mint - 200 g;
peanut butter;
syrups

बायां शौचालय साफ है। फ्लैश के साथ शौचालय का समग्र फोटो लें, ताकि फर्श, दीवारें, प्लंबिंग दिखाई दें

रेस्तरां के उद्घाटन के लिए - शौचालय साफ होना चाहिए:
 - दीवारें धब्बों के बिना;
- प्लंबिंग साफ है (सिंक, टॉयलेट - टॉर्च से जांचें);
- ब्रश साफ है, ब्रश का कटोरा साफ है;
- डिस्पेंसर भरे हुए हैं;
- टॉयलेट पेपर लटका हुआ है;
- हाथों के लिए नैपकिन - पूरा डिस्पेंसर
- सिंक अवरुद्ध नहीं है (जांचें, पानी कैसे बहता है)
- बाल्टी साफ है, कचरे के बैग के साथ;
- फर्श साफ है (टॉर्च से जांचें);
- दर्पण साफ है;
- जांचें कि पौधा मुरझाया नहीं है, मिट्टी नम है

यदि नहीं - क्लीनर को कार्य दें। 12:00 बजे तक यह समाप्त होना चाहिए।

